The EVA material provides comfortable cushioning and helps reduce stress on joints and knees during exercise. The mat’s surface promotes better body stability and makes workouts more comfortable when performing various asanas, stretching, and strength exercises.

With a thickness of 0.6 cm, the mat combines convenience, compactness, and sufficient softness for daily workouts. Its lightweight design makes it easy to carry to classes, picnics, camping trips, or use at home.

