description_en:
The single socket Mono Electric Despina 102-170021-117 in cream color is designed for safe connection of household electrical appliances in residential and commercial premises. The flush-mounted design provides a neat appearance and allows the product to blend naturally into the interior. The presence of a grounding contact increases safety during the operation of connected equipment.

The socket is used in apartments, private houses, offices, hotels, and other premises with internal electrical wiring. It is suitable for connecting most household devices — from small appliances and chargers to more powerful equipment designed for standard mains supply. The cream color makes the product a universal solution for interiors with a classic or neutral design, where a soft color palette is preferred.

The model belongs to the Mono Electric Despina series and is designed for internal installation in standard mounting boxes. The construction ensures a tight fit and reliable fixation of the mechanism. The contact group is designed for stable long-term operation, and the grounding element allows the socket to be used with devices requiring additional protection. The product is intended for installation in dry indoor areas in accordance with the IP20 protection rating.

Advantages:
flush-mounted installation for a neat appearance;
equipped with grounding contact for safe connection;
suitable for standard household electrical appliances;
cream color for a universal interior solution;
compatible with the Mono Electric Despina series;
secure fixation in the mounting box;
designed for long-term operation;
suitable for residential and commercial premises.

The Mono Electric Despina single socket 102-170021-117 is suitable for organizing safe electrical connection points in interiors. Its practical design and neutral appearance make it a convenient solution for everyday use.

