description_en:
The 2-gang frame Mono Electric Despina in titanium color is designed for installation of two electrical mechanisms — sockets, switches, or other compatible elements of the series. The decorative frame helps neatly finish electrical points and gives the installation area a complete appearance. The titanium color suits modern interiors and blends well with various wall finishes.

The double frame is used in residential premises, offices, hotels, commercial properties, and other spaces where two mechanisms need to be installed side by side. The universal mounting design allows the frame to be installed both horizontally and vertically, making installation more convenient depending on the wiring layout and room configuration. This solution is suitable for organizing socket blocks near workspaces, TVs, household appliances, or for combining lighting switches.

The model is made of ABS plastic — a durable and practical material resistant to everyday use. The frame surface is easy to clean and maintains a neat appearance during long-term use. The design ensures reliable fixation of mechanisms and convenient installation. The frame is compatible with electrical accessories from the Mono Electric Despina series and is intended for indoor installation in dry areas.

Advantages:
designed for installation of two mechanisms;
suitable for sockets and switches of the Despina series;
universal mounting: horizontal and vertical;
made of durable ABS plastic;
titanium color suitable for modern interiors;
helps create a neat appearance for electrical points;
convenient for installation of combined blocks;
resistant to everyday use.

The Mono Electric Despina 2-gang frame is suitable for neat and convenient finishing of sockets and switches in residential and commercial premises. The universal installation format and practical material make it a convenient solution for modern electrical accessories.

description_ka:
