100% natural treat;
long-lasting chewing enjoyment;
supports dental and gum health;
suitable for rewards and training;
no artificial additives or preservatives;
natural taste and aroma;
helps keep your pet occupied;
suitable for dogs of all breeds;
made in Georgia.

Pig ears are an excellent addition to your dog’s diet, helping to maintain your pet’s activity, oral health, and good mood every day.

